{title: Dil Mere Tu Deewana Hai}
{artist: Kumar Sanu Chithra Anu Malik}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]dil mere [D]tu deewaanaa hai
[C]paagal hai [D]maine maanaa hai
[Em]pal [D]pal [C]aahein [Em]bharta hai
[Em]kahne [D]se [C]kyon [Em]Dartaa hai
[Em]Khaamoshiyon ki zubaaN
[Em]koi naa samjhe yahaaN
[A]sahraa mein [Em]gul khilte nahin
[A]milke kabhi [Em]milte nahin
[Em]jaane [D]hai [Em]kiski Khataa
[Em]anjaani [D]ye [Em]raahein [D]
[A]manzil kaa [Em]dengi pataa
[Em]dil mere...
[Em]nadiyon ko ahsaas hai
[Em]saagar mein bhi pyaas hai
[A]maanaa ki [Em]hai anDhera ghanaa
[A]kisne kiyaa [Em]tujhko manaa
[Em]taaro [D]ki [Em]shammaa jalaa
[Em]sach hote, [D]sapne bhi
[A]maine hai [Em]aisaa sunaa
[Em]dil mere...
